# Env

Copy to `.env` locally. After merge, Developer sets **secrets** on Railway (`TELNYX_API_KEY`, `XAI_API_KEY`, `API_KEY`). Do not place real PSTN calls from this repo. Tests mock Telnyx and xAI.

## Required for outbound calls

| Variable | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `TELNYX_API_KEY` | Telnyx Call Control API (Bearer). Set on Railway after merge. |
| `XAI_API_KEY` | xAI Grok Voice Live 2. Set on Railway after merge. |
| `API_KEY` | Bearer token for `POST /api/outbound` and `GET /api/calls/:id`. Set on Railway after merge. |
| `PUBLIC_BASE_URL` | Public HTTPS origin. Telnyx webhook = `{PUBLIC_BASE_URL}/webhooks/telnyx`. |

## Telnyx (non-secret, TRNSF/Nuno)

| Variable | Default | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `TELNYX_CONNECTION_ID` | `3041732714274227469` | Call Control app **TRNSX-Outbound-Grok**. |
| `TELNYX_OUTBOUND_VOICE_PROFILE_ID` | `3041732644774610184` | Outbound Voice Profile bound to that app (not sent on each dial). |
| `FROM_NUMBER` | `+351210210260` | Caller ID. |

## Voice / model

| Variable | Default | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `GROK_VOICE` | `ara` | Grok Voice Live 2 voice. |
| `GROK_MODEL` | `grok-voice-think-fast-2.0` | Grok Voice Live 2 model. |

Language is **pt-PT only** (not configurable).

## Optional

| Variable | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `RESULT_WEBHOOK` | `POST` JSON when a call ends. Empty disables. |
| `TELNYX_PUBLIC_KEY` | Account Ed25519 public key. When set, `/webhooks/telnyx` verifies signatures. |
| `XAI_BASE_URL` | Default `https://api.x.ai`. |
| `TELNYX_API_BASE` | Default `https://api.telnyx.com`. |
| `PORT` | Railway injects this. Default `3000`. |
| `MAX_CALL_SECONDS` | Hard cap before hangup. Default `600`. |

This service is **outbound-only** and is **not** Alice.
